msgid "Using JMS"
msgstr "使用JMS"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use JMS messaging via the\n"
"Apache Qpid JMS AMQP client, or alternatively the Apache ActiveMQ Artemis JMS client."
msgstr "本指南演示了您的 Quarkus 应用程序如何通过 Apache Qpid JMS AMQP 客户端，或者通过 Apache ActiveMQ Artemis JMS 客户端，使用 JMS 消息传递。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "如果你想构建原生可执行程序，可以选择安装Mandrel或者GraalVM，并xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[正确配置](或者使用Docker在容器中进行构建)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "A running Artemis server, or Docker to start one"
msgstr "一个正在运行的 Artemis 服务器，或者用于启动该服务器的 Docker"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "应用结构"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this guide, we are going to generate (random) prices in one component.\n"
"These prices are written to a queue (`prices`) using a JMS client.\n"
"Another component reads from the `prices` queue and stores the latest price.\n"
"The data can be fetched from a browser using a fetch button from a Jakarta REST resource."
msgstr "在本指南中，我们将在一个组件中生成（随机）价格。这些价格将通过 JMS 客户端写入一个队列（ `prices` ）。另一个组件从该 `价格` 队列中读取数据，并存储最新价格。用户可以通过浏览器上的“获取”按钮，从 Jakarta REST 资源中获取这些数据。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guide can be used either via the Apache Qpid JMS AMQP client as detailed immediately below, or\n"
"alternatively with the Apache ActiveMQ Artemis JMS client given some different configuration\n"
"as xref:artemis-jms[detailed later]."
msgstr "该指南既可以通过 Apache Qpid JMS AMQP 客户端使用（详见下文），也可以通过 Apache ActiveMQ Artemis JMS 客户端使用（ xref:artemis-jms[详见下文] ）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Qpid JMS - AMQP"
msgstr "Qpid JMS - AMQP"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the detailed steps below we will use the https://qpid.apache.org/components/jms/[Apache Qpid JMS]\n"
"client via the https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms/[Quarkus Qpid JMS extension]. Qpid JMS\n"
"uses the AMQP 1.0 ISO standard as its wire protocol, allowing it to be used with a variety of\n"
"AMQP 1.0 servers and services such as ActiveMQ Artemis, ActiveMQ 5, Qpid Broker-J, Qpid Dispatch router,\n"
"Azure Service Bus, and more."
msgstr "在下面的详细步骤中，我们将通过 link:https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms/[Quarkus Qpid JMS 扩展] 使用 link:https://qpid.apache.org/components/jms/[Apache Qpid JMS] 客户端。 Qpid JMS 采用 AMQP 1.0 ISO 标准作为其传输协议，因此可与多种 AMQP 1.0 服务器和服务配合使用，例如 ActiveMQ Artemis、ActiveMQ 5、Qpid Broker-J、Qpid Dispatch 路由器、Azure Service Bus 等。"

msgid "Solution"
msgstr "解决方案"

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the completed example."
msgstr "我们建议您按照下一节的说明逐步创建应用程序。然而，您可以直接转到已完成的示例。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Clone the Git repository: `git clone https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms-quickstart.git`,\n"
"or download an https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms-quickstart/archive/main.zip[archive]."
msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库： `git clone https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms-quickstart.git` ，或下载 link:https://github.com/amqphub/quarkus-qpid-jms-quickstart/archive/main.zip[压缩包] 。"

